# Seeded with one pattern; a second arrives while Needles is open and is
# offered the next time Needles comes back.
wait-for Read a pattern
expect Winter socks
companion needles push apps/needles/fixtures/lace-shawl.md --sim
lifecycle background
lifecycle foreground
wait-for 2 patterns from your computer
# With two patterns, Read a pattern lists them and says which were opened.
tap Read a pattern
wait-for Patterns
expect Winter socks
expect Lace shawl
expect Not opened yet
clean
shot patterns
tap Lace shawl
wait-for A top-down triangle
clean
shot reading-first-page
# The page keys turn the pattern; the middle opens its menu, which says the
# page and changes the text size.
page next
wait-idle
page next
wait-idle
expect-missing A top-down triangle
tap-at 536,724
wait-for Page 3 of
expect 100%
# The plus end of the text size stepper; its action names the size it goes to.
tap-at 942,259
wait-for 110%
tap Bookmark
wait-for Bookmarked
clean
shot reading-menu
tap-id 4294967295
wait-idle
expect-missing Bookmarked
# Back from the pattern lands on its project, whose sections are the
# pattern's own.
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for Lace shawl
tap Change section
wait-for Garter tab
expect Border
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for Lace shawl
# The pattern reopens on the page it was left on, after a restart too.
tap Read a pattern
wait-for Patterns
# Lace shawl now opens where it was left; Winter socks is still unopened.
expect Opens where you left it
expect Not opened yet
restart
wait-for Read a pattern
tap Read a pattern
wait-for Patterns
tap Lace shawl
wait-for-id 282227963
wait-idle
expect-missing A top-down triangle
tap-at 536,724
wait-for Page 3 of
tap-id 4294967295
wait-idle
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for Lace shawl
# Projects lists every project with the section and row it is on.
tap Projects
wait-for Row counter
expect Lace shawl
clean
shot projects
tap Lace shawl
wait-for Read a pattern
# A new project starts on the first section of its pattern.
expect Garter tab
